T*
(The material certificate and process history were reviewed. The discussion focused on) Tj
T*
(whether material storage, pre-mould drying or moulding conditions could explain the observed) Tj
T*
(variation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10:18 AM | Suresh V.) Tj
T*
(The available process record did not clearly demonstrate that the required drying cycle had) Tj
T*
(been completed for the affected batch. The team requested a controlled trial with the drying) Tj
T*
(cycle recorded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
