() Tj
T*
(DECISIONS) Tj
T*
(1. Run a controlled material-drying trial at 100  C for 4 hours.) Tj
T*
(2. Repeat compression-set testing and compare with the  15% acceptance limit.) Tj
T*
(3. Update the process record after the trial is reviewed.) Tj
